mark-shot (0.2.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add sharp and rounded arrow tails, multiply blend mode for highlighters, and dynamic dashed text editing outlines.
  * Improve Windows IME context recovery, DIB clipboard compatibility for Lark/Feishu, and Wayland modal window resizing.
  * Hide capture hints on first drag and optimize shortcut input layout.

 -- Mark Shot maintainers <snemc@qq.com>  Thu, 19 Nov 2026 08:00:00 +0900

